# Mission Impossible: Turning Students on to Modern Art.

**Authors:** Jensen, Heather

## Abstract
Addresses the reasons why students resist learning about modern art within humanities courses. Provides strategies for encouraging students to appreciate and critique modern art, such as using comic strips to illuminate beliefs about modern art, studying the theory and practice of a particular artist, or utilizing group critiques of an artwork. (CMK)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ605836

